<title>PHILIPPINES: Picop Q2 net loss 773.289 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Picop Q2 net loss 773.289 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pulp and paper producer PICOP Resources Inc posted a net loss of 773.289 million pesos in the second quarter of the year, documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission said.</p>
<p>Sales amounted to 469.873 million pesos, but operating expenses reached 729.496 million pesos.</p>
<p>Other expenses totalled 16.318 million pesos.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to give comparative figures or the reason for the loss.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418968 Fax 8176267</p>
